{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n 【納豆からの卒業】\n \n \n \n 『スナック眞緒』第６夜のお客様は\n けやき坂46の\n 松田好花ちゃんでした〜\n \n ご来店ありがとうございます😊\n \n もう随分前のことに感じるわね〜\n \n とゆうか\n もう随分前のことね（笑）\n \n お礼ブログが遅くなってしまい\n すみません😢\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHAD1BYMKHWHSNKQYPRG31","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHAE1Z5ZNEZ1GFRPVCPQ7F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHAF0PXQBKTXTBDMQ3V1HN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 納豆からの卒業を熱望していた\n 好花ちゃんですが\n その後どうなったのかしら？\n \n うーん🧐\n どうなったのか\n \n やっぱり\n 納豆から卒業する気配は\n 無さそうな気がするけど\n \n 多才な好花ちゃんですから\n 最近は色んな才能を発揮して\n 今も舞台など\n たくさん活躍されていて\n \n もうキャラが納豆だけ\n じゃ無くなったから\n そんな悩みも消えたように見えるわっ♬\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHAFZQGJ6YFF9GBTGC76YK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHAH12EVFDYBW2MQDPH8BM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n これからもぜひ\n 納豆を愛していってほしいものね💕\n \n \n そういえば最近\n 私も納豆が大好きで\n 今日は6パックも食べてしまったから\n \n 今度好花ちゃんと\n 納豆大食い対決〜とか\n してみたいわ〜💕💕\n \n 納豆なら太らないでしょう！（笑）\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHAJ121QF9X6F1RXK0A9G3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHAK1EV80AE39AS5SBJ3MM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n しっかり者ので\n どこから出てるのかわからないけど\n 溢れ出る品をお持ちの好花ちゃん\n \n これからも\n まおちゃんのことをよろしくね！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHAM0D6QVH3W49XPPF3GMZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHAN2E5FEEWT1XPF50WQNK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHAP4JHDFCCQ7B5QV2T6AC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHAQ4VJ8RXWS5AEDK0BFYX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n またのご来店\n お待ちしてます〜✨✨🥂"}],"source":"archive"}